red\">Feared</a> condition.</li>\n<li><b>Blamana</b>: explodes in a big area, healing the boss up to 7,000 if in range</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 342 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Platinum Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Platinum_Coin_c8a106.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>15-94</td>\n<td>47.3</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Pearl\"><img alt=\"White Pearl\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/White_Pearl_d0ee7e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Pearl\">White Pearl</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-6</td>\n<td>1.3</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"52.631579\" style=\"text-align:center;\">53%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Pearl\"